<%@ page language="java" contentType="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1"
    pageEncoding="ISO-8859-1"%>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Grand Line Adventures | One Piece</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #e0f7fa;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #d32f2f;
            color: white;
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .description {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #0288d1;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #01579b;
        }
        .log-pose {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #fff9c4;
            border-left: 5px solid #fbc02d;
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #212121;
            color: #bdbdbd;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Set Sail for the Grand Line! ☠️</h1>
        <p>Join Monkey D. Luffy and the Straw Hat Pirates</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>Wealth, Fame, Power...</h2>
        <p class="description">
            Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, attained everything this world has to offer. 
            The words he uttered just before his death drove people to the seas: <br><br>
            <em>"My treasure? If you want it, you can have it. Find it! I left everything this world has to offer there!"</em>
        </p>
        
        <p>Are you ready to claim the <strong>One Piece</strong> and become the next Pirate King?</p>
        
        <a href="#join-crew" class="btn">Board the Thousand Sunny</a>

        <div class="log-pose">
            <h3>🧭 Log Pose Status</h3>
            <p><strong>Current Server Time in the New World:</strong> <br> <%= new java.util.Date() %></p>
            <p><em>The magnetic field is stable. Prepare for your next voyage!</em></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; <%= java.time.Year.now().getValue() %> Straw Hat Grand Fleet. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>